      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER SEAPLANE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind WAKA WAKA (24.29) in a Mix 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can find winning form. WAKA WAKA (3) jumped from a squeeze box last start but was quickly into stride and led throughout to score (24.01) at this track in a Mix 5 over 407m. Can make it two on the bounce. HARA'S FONZIE (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (24.35) in a Mix 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Expected to bounce back to best. PENNY DAZE (7) was well supported last time but could only manage second (24.25), beaten 1.75 lengths. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from six starts. Likely to be in the finish again.",
